<title>USA: KCBT sets July 4 holiday trading schedule.</title>
<headline>KCBT sets July 4 holiday trading schedule.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade said Wednesday it will be closed Friday, July 4, in observance of the Independence Day holiday.</p>
<p>The exchange will observe the following hours for trade on Thursday, July 3:</p>
<p>Contract					 Trading Schedule</p>
<p>Hard Red Winter Wheat Futures/Options  Normal hours</p>
<p>Value Line Futures/Options		 Early close at 1215 CDT</p>
<p>Mini Value Line Futures/Options	  Early close at 1215 CDT</p>
<p>Western Natural Gas Futures/Options    Normal hours</p>
<p>((--Kansas City bureau, 816 561-8671))</p>
